{"type":"Film","id":"ES2015_009","slug":"es2015-009-a-cambio-de-nada","title":{"native":"A cambio de nada","english":"Nothing In Return"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-05-08","year":2015},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Daniel Guzmán","slug":"daniel-guzman","name":"Daniel Guzmán","birthYear":1972,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama","Coming of Age"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3211400/mediaviewer/rm1217651712/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V3qXCDkSmrI"},"synopsis":{"native":"Darío, un chico de dieciséis años, disfruta de la vida con Luismi, su vecino y amigo del alma. Mantienen una amistad incondicional, se conocen desde niños y juntos han descubierto todo lo que saben de la vida. Tras la separación de sus padres, Darío huye de casa y empieza a trabajar en el taller de Caralimpia, un viejo delincuente con aires de triunfador, que le enseña el oficio y los beneficios de la vida. Darío conoce además a Antonia, una anciana que recoge muebles abandonados con su motocarrro. A su lado descubre otra forma de ver la vida. Luismi, Caralimpia y Antonia se convierten en su nueva familia durante un verano que les cambiará la vida.","english":"A teen from a dysfunctional home in Madrid skips school to hang out with a friend and raise bail money for a shop owner who fences stolen bike parts."},"production":[{"country":"Spain","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"ES2015_009_01","film":"ES2015_009","person":{"id":"Antonia Guzmán","slug":"antonia-guzman","name":"Antonia Guzmán","birthYear":1922,"deathYear":2018,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"age":"4: Fourth Age (>75)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Lower class","profession":"Self-employed","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"},{"id":"ES2015_009_02","film":"ES2